  (text "Sheet: I2C Sensors\n\nPurpose: IMU, temperature, hall effect and color sensors\n\nPlanned contents:\n  - U: ICM-42605 IMU\n  - U: LM75ADP temperature sensor\n  - U: TMAG5273A2QDBVR hall effect sensor\n  - U: VEML3328 color sensor\n  - Each device on its own I2C address; bus pull-ups sized for bus capacitance\n  - Note placement needs (IMU near board centre, hall/color/temp exposed)" (at 20.32 20.32 0)
